<title>HONG KONG: Daehan Investment Bnk sets $100mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Daehan Investment Bnk sets $100mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arrangers.</p>
<p>BORROWER DAEHAN INVESTMENT BANKING CORP</p>
<p> AMOUNT   US$100 MLN   COUPON    LIBOR+60 BP MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	   ISS PRICE PAR	   LAUNCH    27.FEB.97</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	   CALLS     NONE	  REPLIES   --</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	   REPAYMENT BULLET	DENOMS    US$250K</p>
<p> RATING   --	     SALE LMTS STANDARD    TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> HOME CTRY S.KOREA     GOV LAW   ENGLISH     PAY DATE  --</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	   CO-ARRANGERS   US$8 MLN+   60 BP ALL-IN 80 BP</p>
<p>	   CO-LEAD MGRS   US$5-7 MLN  54 BP ALL-IN 78 BP</p>
<p>	   SENIOR MGRS    US$3-4 MLN  51 BP ALL-IN 77 BP</p>
<p>ARRANGERS COMMERZ EAST ASIA, KDB ASIA, SOCGEN ASIA, AND WESTLB</p>
<p>	     ASIA PACIFIC</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
